{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1493919-\u2018shrooms","id":1493919,"title":"\u2018Shrooms","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-09-28T11:43:12-07:00","id":1493919,"title":"\u2018Shrooms","content":"I had a disturbing idea the other day, one somewhat inspired by Ashe and then Ashefinders. <br /> <br /> So some of the Hecate, among other with access to the right powers, start growing psilocybin mushrooms on zombies and themselves. Consuming the mushrooms does\u2026 things to the consumer. I am still working on the details. But while Ashe only works on the thin bloods, these \u2018shrooms work on any living person.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-30T17:40:21-07:00","id":1494065,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:14px\">Right.<br /> <br /> Back to this\u2026<br /> <br /> So eating zombie-psilocybin mushrooms allows the person who ate the mushroom to experience something from the existence of the zombie, or Hecata vampire. Yes, these can be grown on zombies, corpses and Hecata with poor hygiene habits. These scenes are vivid, temporarily consuming and may be frightening or even traumatic.<br /> <br /> Mechanically, they allow a human to experience a vampire\u2019s memorium (V5, pg 311).<br /> <br /> Normally taking \u2018shrooms means someone experiences \u201c\u2026<span style=\"color:#202122\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\">shifts in perception visually include enhancement and contrasting of colors, strange light phenomena (such as auras or &quot;halos&quot; around light sources), increased visual acuity, surfaces that seem to ripple, shimmer, or breathe; complex open and closed eye visuals of </span></span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Form_constant\" target=\"_blank\">form constants</a><span style=\"color:#202122\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"> or images\u2026\u201d They usually do not live out a scene where they are a 19th century Duke bitching about how the peasants taste these days.<br /> <br /> And <i>any</i> mortal who consumes one of these </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">zombie-</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">psilocybin mushrooms may have such an experience.</span><br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-02T15:57:18-07:00","id":1494160,"title":"","content":"Seems like a potential masquerade breach? And getting zombie memories sounds pretty traumatic, could use that as a weapon maybe?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Exalted Whose Name is Carved in Leaves of Jade<br /> Senator of the Greater Chamber<br /> Champion of the Silver Pact<br /> Chosen of the Little Gods<br /> Agent of Fate","edited":{"userid":988,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","user":"Mizu","date":". 10-02-2022, 07:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/988-mizu","name":"Mizu","avatar":"https://